  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Vulnerable Migrants Repatriated to Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To respond to the protection needs of the Haitian repatriated migrants upon arrival, the project will provide comprehensive assistance (psychosocial support, medical and documentation assistance, water and hot meals etc.) in order to alleviate their suffering and ensure a dignified return home. In addition the project will project will sensitize the communities about the risk of irregular movements while promoting safe and orderly migration, hence access to documentation and regular pathways.</narrative>
  </description>
